# UPI QR Code Demos

This site showcases how to generate UPI QR codes using the `upiqrcode` library in various frameworks and plain HTML.

## Demos

- [React Demo](/docs/react-demo.md)
- [Vue Demo](/docs/vue-demo.md)
- [Svelte Demo](/docs/svelte-demo.md)
- [Plain HTML Demo](/docs/html-demo.md)

Each demo includes an interactive island component that loads the `upiqrcode` library from CDN and renders a QR code based on user input.

---

## How to Run

```bash
# Start the Astro dev server in background mode
astro dev --background
```

Navigate to `http://localhost:4321` to view the demos.
